mportant to be listened to do  you think the younger you  who didn't feel like she fitted into a  box  um and didn't really feel like she  fitted in like you were saying earlier  do you think that she would be so proud  of you  sitting here today i don't know young  catherine was pretty  pretty tough pretty tough she'd probably  she'd probably be like you're doing all  right  no i i you know this like  i like i said like i grew up in in perth  which is a small city in australia and  i loved it and it's one of the most  magical places on earth for me  but doing this like it didn't feel like  tangible let alone a possibility for so  many years so  it's so incredible even the fact that  i'm sitting here  and able to talk to you about any of  this is  i'm just i'm just so grateful and i'm  always going to be grateful for that  because i  truly like love all of this thanks for  taking the time out speak to me  thank you so much you too and thank you  for the time this has been really  nice and uplifting so thank you  you
 

